  "slug": "verify-tally-day-book-totals",
  "title": "How to Compare One Day in the Tally Day Book",
  "description": "Reconcile a daily view by matching the company, date and voucher list before investigating a difference in totals.",
  "category": "Vouchers and Day Book",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Start with one calendar day",
      "body": "Pick a day and select the same company and date in each view. Confirm whether the report is showing all entries or a selected voucher type. A daily sales total cannot be compared directly with a daily total that also includes receipts."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Compare voucher identities first",
      "body": "List any entries that appear on only one side using their type, number, date and party. For illustration, if two views show 11 and 12 entries, locate the extra entry before comparing each amount. If the lists agree, inspect the amounts on the matching vouchers."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Record the difference for follow-up",
      "body": "Check the most recent successful sync. Keep a note of the one differing voucher or the exact amount mismatch and ask the person responsible for the books to confirm the source entry. A small, specific comparison is easier to resolve than a total with no voucher details."
    }
  ],
